          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The second song model beside YuE2: ACE-Step 1.5 through acestep.cpp. A description of the style instead of tags; lyrics, tempo, key, metre and length are written and picked by the language model wherever you leave them open. The songs go into the same library."
